WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:02.730
«L'inutile et monstrueuse tour Eiffel».

2
00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:05.780
That is what leading artists and
writers called it in the press,

3
00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:09.320
in 1887. It was meant to last 20 years.

4
00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:16.130
1989: a glass and steel pyramid rises
in the Louvre's royal courtyard.

5
00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:18.910
Many call it an insult to heritage.

6
00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:24.000
In 2019, fire destroys the
spire of «Notre-Dame de Paris».

7
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.400
Rebuild it as it was,

8
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.330
or add something modern?

9
00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:30.290
So who decides what great art is?

10
00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:33.810
In this mission, you'll follow
three scandals on a timeline,

11
00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:38.060
then meet «l'Académie française»
and «le prix Goncourt».

12
00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:40.550
Then you'll read a picture layer by layer,

13
00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:43.180
and argue who should pay for culture.

14
00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:46.930
Your mission: find out who
decides what great art is,

15
00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:48.430
and make your own judgement.
